3 (Healthy to Radiant)", "current_score": "Score 1 - Mild Glow"}, {"parameter": "Comedonal Density", "target_score": "Score 0 - No Comedones", "current_score": "Score 1 - Mild Comedonal Activity"}, {"parameter": "Texture Irregularities Beyond Pores", "target_score": "Score 0 - Smooth / Even Texture", "current_score": "Score 1 - Mild Textural Irregularities"}, {"parameter": "Regional Oil Distribution", "target_score": "Score 0 - Even / Balanced Oil Distribution", "current_score": "Score 1 - T-zone Predominant"}]}',
