shift a full grade.", "target_single_session_score": "2"}, {"parameter": "Peri-Orbital Health Score", "current_score": "2", "is_primary_concern": false, "reason_for_selection": "Mild shadowing/clarity loss can improve with hydration, cooling, and brightening care.", "target_single_session_score": "1"}, {"parameter": "Lip Pigmentation Score", "current_score": "2", "is_primary_concern": false, "reason_for_selection": "Mild intrinsic pigmentation typically needs multiple sessions; minimal immediate change expected.", "target_single_session_score": "2"}, {"parameter": "Textual Radiance Index", "current_score": "2", "is_primary_concern": false, "reason_for_selection": "Keratin specks on Woods suggest quick radiance gains after exfoliation and hydration.", "target_single_session_score": "1"}]}',
